  "@type": "Pantheon",
  "name": "Mongol and Kalmyk Saga Figures",
  "tradition": "Mongol / Kalmyk (Buddhist-era tale cycles)",
  "description": "Supernatural figures of the Kalmyk and Mongol tale cycles (the Siddhi-kür and the Ardschi-Bordschi tales), which carry Indian story material into Mongol Buddhist tradition.",
